{"articleNo":"2427","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2427&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-1학기 수료자 등록 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.25","hit":"14741","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"54\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2010-1학기 대학원 수료자 등록 신청 안내 </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수료(예정)자 중&nbsp; 2010년 8월</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 학위를 받기위한 학위청구나 논문연구를 계속할 학생은 아래와 같이 수료자 등록을 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 수료생은 누구나 신청(수료 후 논문제출 시한 폐지)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 수료자 등록구분 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 :&nbsp; 연구 논문을 제출하고자 하는자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">논문연구등록 :&nbsp; 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 불합격자) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수료자 등록신청기간 : </span><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2010. 2. 1(월) ~ 2. 3(수) [3일간]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"4\">(수료자 등록신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 승인을&nbsp;받으셔야 됩니다.)</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5%, 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 2. 16(화) ~ 2. 19(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리/고지서출력</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협,대구은행,&nbsp;신한은행&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"31\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"123\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대학원별</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"31\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">분야별</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1